{"total_count": 70, "results": [{"visibility": "domain", "fields": [{"name": "data", "description": null, "annotations": {"timeserie_precision": "month"}, "label": "Date", "type": "date", "label_en": "Date", "label_pt": "Data", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "ano", "description": null, "annotations": {"facet": true, "facetsort": "-count", "timeserie_precision": "hour"}, "label": "Year", "type": "text", "label_en": "Year", "label_pt": "Ano", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "mes", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Month", "type": "text", "label_en": "Month", "label_pt": "M\u00eas", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "con_name", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Municipality", "type": "text", "label_en": "Municipality", "label_pt": "Concelho", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "pedidos_ligacao_rede_executados_nr", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Network Connection Requests Executed", "type": "int", "label_en": "Network Connection Requests Executed", "label_pt": "Pedidos de Liga\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 Rede Executados", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "cod_concelho", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Municipality Code", "type": "text", "label_en": "Municipality Code", "label_pt": "C\u00f3digo Concelho", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}], "dataset_id": "9-plr-mobilidade-eletrica", "dataset_uid": "da_j0w96n", "has_records": true, "features": ["analyze", "timeserie"], "attachments": [], "alternative_exports": [], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"default": {"title": "New grid connections associated with electric mobility", "title_en": "New grid connections associated with electric mobility", "title_pt": "Novas liga\u00e7\u00f5es \u00e0 rede associados \u00e0 mobilidade el\u00e9trica", "description": "<p>Number of new connections to the Grid associated with Electric Mobility per municipality (integrated into the Mobi.e network). Monthly.</p><p><br></p><p>1. The information made available by E-REDES constitutes an approximation to the values taken from the system and is based on the moment in which it is collected. Given that the connection points, the electricity distribution network, and the consumption and production values themselves are naturally very dynamic, it is safeguarded that the information made available may be subject to subsequent changes and updates, with the exception of any omissions and/or occasional inaccuracies of location that the information may contain.<br></p><p>2. In this way, E-REDES is not liable to third parties, namely, partners, service providers, contractors, users and customers, for damages that may arise as a result, direct or indirect, of the use of this Information, in particular when carrying out interventions, calculations and/or estimates, without confirming the accuracy and updating of the data, whereby it is duly noted that the consultation of this information does not affect the duty to promote a direct consultation with E-REDES in order to obtain updated information.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">The data provided by the E-REDES Open Data Portal is covered by open licenses (CC BY 4.0). There are no restrictions on access, under the commitment that data users cite the publisher.\u00a0Therefore, we suggest that you cite the Open Data E-REDES Portal as:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">E-REDES \u2013 Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de Eletricidade, \u201cE-REDES Open Data Portal\u201d. Accessed in \u201cData\u201d. [Online] Available at </span><a aria-label=\"Link https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\" dir=\"ltr\"></span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">If you share on social media, please add #PortalOpenData_E_REDES</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><br></span></p>", "description_en": "<p>Number of new connections to the Grid associated with Electric Mobility per municipality (integrated into the Mobi.e network). Monthly.</p><p><br></p><p>1. The information made available by E-REDES constitutes an approximation to the values taken from the system and is based on the moment in which it is collected. Given that the connection points, the electricity distribution network, and the consumption and production values themselves are naturally very dynamic, it is safeguarded that the information made available may be subject to subsequent changes and updates, with the exception of any omissions and/or occasional inaccuracies of location that the information may contain.<br></p><p>2. In this way, E-REDES is not liable to third parties, namely, partners, service providers, contractors, users and customers, for damages that may arise as a result, direct or indirect, of the use of this Information, in particular when carrying out interventions, calculations and/or estimates, without confirming the accuracy and updating of the data, whereby it is duly noted that the consultation of this information does not affect the duty to promote a direct consultation with E-REDES in order to obtain updated information.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">The data provided by the E-REDES Open Data Portal is covered by open licenses (CC BY 4.0). There are no restrictions on access, under the commitment that data users cite the publisher.\u00a0Therefore, we suggest that you cite the Open Data E-REDES Portal as:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">E-REDES \u2013 Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de Eletricidade, \u201cE-REDES Open Data Portal\u201d. Accessed in \u201cData\u201d. [Online] Available at </span><a aria-label=\"Link https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\" dir=\"ltr\"></span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">If you share on social media, please add #PortalOpenData_E_REDES</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><br></span></p>", "description_pt": "<p>N\u00famero de novas liga\u00e7\u00f5es \u00e0 Rede associados \u00e0 Mobilidade El\u00e9trica por concelho (integrados na rede Mobi.e). Mensal.</p><p><br></p><p>1. A Informa\u00e7\u00e3o disponibilizada pela E-REDES constitui uma aproxima\u00e7\u00e3o aos valores retirados de sistema e tem por refer\u00eancia o momento em que a mesma \u00e9 recolhida. Atendendo a que os pontos de liga\u00e7\u00e3o, a rede de distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade, e os pr\u00f3prios valores de consumo e de produ\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00e3o naturalmente muito din\u00e2micos, salvaguarda-se que a informa\u00e7\u00e3o disponibilizada poder\u00e1 ser objeto de subsequentes altera\u00e7\u00f5es e atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es, ficando igualmente ressalvadas eventuais omiss\u00f5es e/ou pontuais imprecis\u00f5es de localiza\u00e7\u00e3o que a informa\u00e7\u00e3o poder\u00e1 conter.</p><p>2. Desta forma a E-REDES n\u00e3o se responsabiliza perante terceiros, nomeadamente, parceiros, prestadores de servi\u00e7os, empreiteiros, utentes e clientes, pelos danos que possam surgir em consequ\u00eancia, direta ou indireta, do uso da presente Informa\u00e7\u00e3o, em particular aquando da realiza\u00e7\u00e3o de interven\u00e7\u00f5es, c\u00e1lculos e/ou estimativas, sem confirma\u00e7\u00e3o da exatid\u00e3o e atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o dos dados, pelo que devidamente se ressalva de que a consulta da presente informa\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o prejudica o dever de se promover uma consulta direta \u00e0 E-REDES para obter informa\u00e7\u00e3o atualizada.</p><div><br></div><div><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">Os dados fornecidos pelo Portal Open Data da E-REDES s\u00e3o abrangidos por licen\u00e7as abertas (</span><a aria-label=\"Link CC BY 4.0\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\">CC BY 4.0</a><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">). N\u00e3o existem restri\u00e7\u00f5es ao seu acesso, sob o compromisso de os utilizadores dos dados citarem o publicador. Assim, sugerimos que cite o Portal Open Data E-REDES como:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">E-REDES \u2013 Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade, \u201cPortal Open Data E-REDES\u201d. Acedido em \u201cData\u201d. [Online] Dispon\u00edvel em </span><a aria-label=\"Link https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/</span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">Se partilhar nas redes sociais, por favor acrescente #PortalOpenData_E_REDES</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><br></span></p></span></div>", "theme": ["Electric Mobility"], "theme_en": ["Electric Mobility"], "theme_pt": ["Mobilidade El\u00e9trica"], "keyword": null, "keyword_en": null, "keyword_pt": null, "license": "CC BY 4.0", "license_en": "CC BY 4.0", "license_pt": "CC BY 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "license_url_en": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "license_url_pt": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "language": "pt", "modified": "2026-09-03T12:37:29+00:00", "publisher": "E-REDES", "publisher_en": "E-REDES", "publisher_pt": "E-REDES", "references": null, "attributions": null, "update_frequency": null, "bbox": null, "data_processed": "2026-02-06T09:30:22+00:00", "federated": false, "geographic_reference": ["world_pt"], "geographic_reference_auto": false, "geometry_types": null, "metadata_languages": ["pt", "en"], "metadata_processed": "2026-11-06T09:30:30.025000+00:00", "modified_updates_on_data_change": false, "modified_updates_on_metadata_change": true, "parent_domain": null, "records_count": 1449, "shared_catalog": null, "source_dataset": null, "source_domain": null, "source_domain_address": null, "source_domain_title": null, "territory": ["Portugal"], "timezone": "Europe/Lisbon"}, "custom": {"perfis-de-utilizacao": ["Academia", "Developer", "Mun\u00edcipio"], "atualizado": null}}}, {"visibility": "domain", "fields": [{"name": "codigo_postal", "description": null, "annotations": {"facet": true, "sortable": true, "facetsort": "alphanum"}, "label": "Postal Code", "type": "text", "label_en": "Postal Code", "label_pt": "C\u00f3digo postal", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "dataset_url", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Dataset URL", "type": "text", "label_en": "Dataset URL", "label_pt": "Dataset URL", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "dataset_identifier", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Dataset Identifier", "type": "text", "label_en": "Dataset Identifier", "label_pt": "Dataset Identifier", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}], "dataset_id": "consumo_horario_codigo_postal_7_digitos", "dataset_uid": "da_p4gkav", "has_records": true, "features": ["analyze", "custom_view"], "attachments": [], "alternative_exports": [], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"default": {"title": "Hourly Consumption by Postal Code - 7 Digits", "title_en": "Hourly Consumption by Postal Code - 7 Digits", "title_pt": "Consumo Hor\u00e1rio por C\u00f3digo Postal - 7 D\u00edgitos", "description": "<p>This DataSet is built based on the load diagrams collected by smart meters. In cases where there are not yet meters with the capacity to carry out these collections, or there is difficulty in communicating with them, consumption profiling is carried out.</p><p>See here the document that systematizes the methodology for estimating the different profiles. (https://www.e-redes.pt/sites/eredes/files/2021-08/DocMetodologico_Perfis.pdf)</p><p>Due to the high volume of data, this dataset presents information for a period of thirty days, in a sliding window model, without historical conservation. For longer temporal analyses, regular data extraction is recommended.</p><p>The load diagrams for different postal codes can be consulted through the \"Table\" tab, or through the \"Pesquisar C\u00f3digo Postal\" tab to filter on a specific postal code.</p><p>In accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), it is necessary to aggregate postal codes, which are not available individually, into the \"OUTROS\" set.</p><p><br></p><p>1. The information made available by E-REDES constitutes an approximation to the values taken from the system and is based on the moment in which it is collected. Given that the connection points, the electricity distribution network, and the consumption and production values themselves are naturally very dynamic, it is safeguarded that the information made available may be subject to subsequent changes and updates, with the exception of any omissions and/or occasional inaccuracies of location that the information may contain.<br></p><p>2. In this way, E-REDES is not liable to third parties, namely, partners, service providers, contractors, users and customers, for damages that may arise as a result, direct or indirect, of the use of this Information, in particular when carrying out interventions, calculations and/or estimates, without confirming the accuracy and updating of the data, whereby it is duly noted that the consultation of this information does not affect the duty to promote a direct consultation with E-REDES in order to obtain updated information.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">The data provided by the E-REDES Open Data Portal is covered by open licenses (CC BY 4.0). There are no restrictions on access, under the commitment that data users cite the publisher.\u00a0Therefore, we suggest that you cite the Open Data E-REDES Portal as:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">E-REDES \u2013 Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de Eletricidade, \u201cE-REDES Open Data Portal\u201d. Accessed in \u201cData\u201d. [Online] Available at </span><a aria-label=\"Link https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\" dir=\"ltr\"></span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">If you share on social media, please add #PortalOpenData_E_REDES</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><br></span></p>", "description_en": "<p>This DataSet is built based on the load diagrams collected by smart meters. In cases where there are not yet meters with the capacity to carry out these collections, or there is difficulty in communicating with them, consumption profiling is carried out.</p><p>See here the document that systematizes the methodology for estimating the different profiles. (https://www.e-redes.pt/sites/eredes/files/2021-08/DocMetodologico_Perfis.pdf)</p><p>Due to the high volume of data, this dataset presents information for a period of thirty days, in a sliding window model, without historical conservation. For longer temporal analyses, regular data extraction is recommended.</p><p>The load diagrams for different postal codes can be consulted through the \"Table\" tab, or through the \"Pesquisar C\u00f3digo Postal\" tab to filter on a specific postal code.</p><p>In accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), it is necessary to aggregate postal codes, which are not available individually, into the \"OUTROS\" set.</p><p><br></p><p>1. The information made available by E-REDES constitutes an approximation to the values taken from the system and is based on the moment in which it is collected. Given that the connection points, the electricity distribution network, and the consumption and production values themselves are naturally very dynamic, it is safeguarded that the information made available may be subject to subsequent changes and updates, with the exception of any omissions and/or occasional inaccuracies of location that the information may contain.<br></p><p>2. In this way, E-REDES is not liable to third parties, namely, partners, service providers, contractors, users and customers, for damages that may arise as a result, direct or indirect, of the use of this Information, in particular when carrying out interventions, calculations and/or estimates, without confirming the accuracy and updating of the data, whereby it is duly noted that the consultation of this information does not affect the duty to promote a direct consultation with E-REDES in order to obtain updated information.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">The data provided by the E-REDES Open Data Portal is covered by open licenses (CC BY 4.0). There are no restrictions on access, under the commitment that data users cite the publisher.\u00a0Therefore, we suggest that you cite the Open Data E-REDES Portal as:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">E-REDES \u2013 Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de Eletricidade, \u201cE-REDES Open Data Portal\u201d. Accessed in \u201cData\u201d. [Online] Available at </span><a aria-label=\"Link https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\" dir=\"ltr\"></span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">If you share on social media, please add #PortalOpenData_E_REDES</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><br></span></p>", "description_pt": "<p style=\"\">Este DataSet \u00e9 constru\u00eddo com base nos diagramas de carga recolhidos pelos contadores inteligentes. Em casos onde n\u00e3o existem ainda contadores com a capacidade de realizar estas recolhas, ou exista dificuldade de comunica\u00e7\u00e3o com os mesmos, \u00e9 realizada uma perfilagem de consumos.</p><p style=\"\">Consulte aqui o documento que sistematiza a metodologia de estima\u00e7\u00e3o dos diferentes perfis. (https://www.e-redes.pt/sites/eredes/files/2021-08/DocMetodologico_Perfis.pdf)</p><p style=\"\">Devido ao elevado volume de dados, este dataset apresenta a informa\u00e7\u00e3o relativa a um per\u00edodo de trinta dias, num modelo de janela deslizante, sem conserva\u00e7\u00e3o de hist\u00f3rico. Para an\u00e1lises temporais mais longas, recomenda-se a extra\u00e7\u00e3o regular de dados.</p><p style=\"\">A consulta dos diagramas de carga dos diferentes c\u00f3digos postais pode ser feito atrav\u00e9s do separador \"Tabela\", ou atrav\u00e9s do separador \"Pesquisar C\u00f3digo Postal\" para filtrar a um c\u00f3digo postal em espec\u00edfico.</p><p style=\"\">De acordo com Regulamento Geral de Prote\u00e7\u00e3o de Dados (RGPD), \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio realizar a agrega\u00e7\u00e3o de c\u00f3digos postais, que n\u00e3o est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis individualmente, no conjunto \"OUTROS\".</p><p style=\"\"><br></p><p style=\"\">1. A Informa\u00e7\u00e3o disponibilizada pela E-REDES constitui uma aproxima\u00e7\u00e3o aos valores retirados de sistema e tem por refer\u00eancia o momento em que a mesma \u00e9 recolhida. Atendendo a que os pontos de liga\u00e7\u00e3o, a rede de distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade, e os pr\u00f3prios valores de consumo e de produ\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00e3o naturalmente muito din\u00e2micos, salvaguarda-se que a informa\u00e7\u00e3o disponibilizada poder\u00e1 ser objeto de subsequentes altera\u00e7\u00f5es e atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es, ficando igualmente ressalvadas eventuais omiss\u00f5es e/ou pontuais imprecis\u00f5es de localiza\u00e7\u00e3o que a informa\u00e7\u00e3o poder\u00e1 conter.</p><p style=\"\">2. Desta forma a E-REDES n\u00e3o se responsabiliza perante terceiros, nomeadamente, parceiros, prestadores de servi\u00e7os, empreiteiros, utentes e clientes, pelos danos que possam surgir em consequ\u00eancia, direta ou indireta, do uso da presente Informa\u00e7\u00e3o, em particular aquando da realiza\u00e7\u00e3o de interven\u00e7\u00f5es, c\u00e1lculos e/ou estimativas, sem confirma\u00e7\u00e3o da exatid\u00e3o e atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o dos dados, pelo que devidamente se ressalva de que a consulta da presente informa\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o prejudica o dever de se promover uma consulta direta \u00e0 E-REDES para obter informa\u00e7\u00e3o atualizada.</p><p style=\"\"><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">Os dados fornecidos pelo Portal Open Data da E-REDES s\u00e3o abrangidos por licen\u00e7as abertas (</span><a aria-label=\"Link CC BY 4.0\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\">CC BY 4.0</a><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">). N\u00e3o existem restri\u00e7\u00f5es ao seu acesso, sob o compromisso de os utilizadores dos dados citarem o publicador. Assim, sugerimos que cite o Portal Open Data E-REDES como:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">E-REDES \u2013 Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade, \u201cPortal Open Data E-REDES\u201d. Acedido em \u201cData\u201d. [Online] Dispon\u00edvel em </span><a aria-label=\"Link https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/</span></a></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\" dir=\"ltr\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">Se partilhar nas redes sociais, por favor acrescente #PortalOpenData_E_REDES</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><br></span></p>", "theme": ["Consumption and Energy"], "theme_en": ["Consumption and Energy"], "theme_pt": ["Consumos e Energia"], "keyword": null, "keyword_en": null, "keyword_pt": null, "license": "CC BY 4.0", "license_en": "CC BY 4.0", "license_pt": "CC BY 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "license_url_en": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "license_url_pt": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "language": "pt", "modified": "2023-10-26T18:48:40+00:00", "publisher": "E-REDES", "publisher_en": "E-REDES", "publisher_pt": "E-REDES", "references": null, "attributions": null